    <string name="im_bots_help_body">POST JSON to the webhook URL of a bot and the message appears in this group under that name. The request format matches Feishu custom bots, so an existing script only needs a new URL.

Plain text body: {\"msg_type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Build finished\"}}

Signature (optional): sign = base64(hmac_sha256(key = timestamp + newline + secret, data = empty)). Both timestamp and sign go in the JSON body, not in headers.

Limits: 100 requests per minute and 5 per second per bot, bodies up to 20 KB. Send X-Request-Id on retries so the same id only posts once.</string>
